James Rising reached out to Samuel Fankhauser regarding potential opportunities at the Smith School, expressing his interest in relocating from the University of Delaware due to deteriorating conditions in the US and a desire for a better environment to raise his children. Sam responded positively, acknowledging James's work and suggesting a chat, proposing the second half of September for a meeting. James then drafted a professional email confirming his availability after 14:00 UK time on the 23rd, reassuring Sam that he does not expect US salaries in the UK. He also provided a link for scheduling the conversation.
